      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Firefall Mountain is the place where the Lord\r\nFire Dragon takes his rest.\r\nNow, it has become a den of monsters.\r\nThe gate is tightly sealed, and only\r\nI am able to open it.",
        "Jp" : "火垂れ山は火竜様がお休みになられていた場所です\r\n今や魔窟となってしまいましたが\r\n門は固く閉ざされ、開門はわたし以外には不可能です"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 652010,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 8
    }, {
