      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In other words, there is no need to worry about\r\npeople entering without cause.",
        "Jp" : "つまり、人が無暗に入り込むという\r\n心配だけはありません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722863,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 9
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It is most regrettable, but...\r\nNow that things have turned out like this, All I\r\ncould do was run away.",
        "Jp" : "ふがいないことですが――\r\nあんなことになってしまった今\r\n私にできることは逃げることだけでした"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722864,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 10
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
