      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The other day, thanks to the removal of the Orcs,\r\nthe merchants who were scared off have started\r\ncoming to this place as well.\r\nIt seems that we will be able to provide better\r\nsupport goods than ever before.",
        "Jp" : "先日、オークどもを排除していただいたことで\r\nオークを恐れていた商人たちが\r\nこの場へもやってくるようになりました\r\nこれまでよりも良い支援品をお渡しできそうです"
