    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What kind of face do I present at the gate now?\r\nBack then, I barely survived.\r\nBut now, there are the Arisen, the Liberation\r\nArmy, and even the bandits.\r\n—It's reassuring.",
        "Jp" : "今更どのような顔でこの門前に戻れば良いのか――\r\nしかし、あの時は殺されずにいるだけで\r\n精一杯でしたが、今は覚者様や解放軍\r\nそして盗賊である彼らまでいる――心強いことです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 652030,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 18
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Master Arisen, beyond the gate\r\nlies a den of monsters.\r\nThey roam freely, seeking to extinguish the\r\nflames of life that burn within those who\r\ndare to tread this path.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様、門の先は魔窟です\r\n魔物が跋扈し、道ゆく者の命の炎を消さんと\r\n襲いかかってくることでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722871,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 19
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 24,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The power to move forward lies only with\r\nthe esteemed Arisen.\r\nBeyond the gate, there is nary a\r\nvillage nor stronghold.\r\nPlease proceed with caution.",
        "Jp" : "先へ進むことができる力を持つのは\r\n覚者様たちだけということになります\r\n無論、門より向こうには村も拠点もありません\r\n心して向かってください"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722872,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 20
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4512,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Bacias",
      "Jp" : "バシアス"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 23778,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, have you strengthened your equipment?\r\nIt seems that the warriors of the Liberation Army\r\nare obtaining new materials one after another.\r\nIt may be good to share information with them.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様、武具は強化されているでしょうか？\r\n解放軍の戦士たちは、続々と新たな素材を\r\n手に入れているそうです\r\n一度、彼らと情報共有をしても良いかもしれません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 652043,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 22
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 26,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In various places, there are doors sealed by the\r\ncommand of the Royal Family.\r\nLet us release them under my name.\r\nFor it is in the path opened by the Arisen that\r\nthe future of this country shall flourish.",
        "Jp" : "各地には、王家の命により封じられている扉があります\r\nそれらを私の名の元に全て解放いたしましょう\r\n覚者様の切り開かれる先に\r\nこの国の未来があるのですから"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722874,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 21
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 27,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Allow me to also inform you\r\nof the whereabouts of valuable resources.\r\nThey are highly dangerous, and until now,\r\nI hesitated to share this information.\r\nBut... in the presence of a wise Arisen,\r\nit is a place that holds no fears.",
        "Jp" : "わたしからも、優れた資源の在り処を\r\nお伝えいたしましょう\r\n危険度が高く、今まではお伝えするのをためらって\r\nいましたが――覚者様ならば、ものともされない場です"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 785592,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 23
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4512,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Bacias",
      "Jp" : "バシアス"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 23779,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 28,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Acre Selund, the Land of Flames.\r\nPerhaps due to this, even in death, there are\r\nbeings that wander, clad in flames, like\r\n\"shadows.\" They will be seen roaming about.",
        "Jp" : "アッカーシェランは炎の国\r\nそのせいか、死して体を失ってなお\r\n炎を纏って徘徊する\"影\"のようなものが\r\n歩き回っていることもあります"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 652044,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 24
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 29,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You may have already seen it, Arisen.\r\nFor example, those who fly in the sky, and those\r\nwho race on the ground— \"Flames\" that take on the\r\nform of such beings.",
        "Jp" : "すでに覚者様もご覧になったかもしれません\r\n例えば、空を飛ぶもの、地を駆けるもの――\r\nそれらの姿をした\"炎\"を"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722875,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 25
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 30,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In places where Dragon Force accumulates, they\r\nare attracted to it and gather together.\r\nThat's also a possibility.",
        "Jp" : "竜力の溜まりやすい場所には\r\nそれらが惹かれ、集まってくることも\r\nあります"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722876,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 26
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 31,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Please be careful.\r\nEven though it may be a shadow clad in flames, do\r\nnot underestimate it, as it could\r\ninflict serious injuries.",
        "Jp" : "ご注意ください\r\n炎を纏った影とはいえ、甘く見ては\r\n深手を負わされかねません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722877,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 27
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4512,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Bacias",
      "Jp" : "バシアス"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 23780,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 32,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's quite hot inside due to the magma...\r\nthough not unbearable.\r\nEspecially to a person of your caliber, Ser!",
        "Jp" : "中はマグマの影響によりかなりの暑さですが\r\n耐えきれぬほどではありません\r\n覚者様ほどの方であればなおさらでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722878,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 29
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 33,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, it is said that among the royalty who\r\nventured deep into this cave in the past, more\r\nthan a few undid their precious jewelry, finding\r\nthe increasing heat unbearable.",
        "Jp" : "しかし、過去この奥へと進まれた王族方の中には\r\n熱くなってゆく貴金属が肌を焼くのを嫌い、\r\n外しながら進んで行かれる方も珍しくなかったとか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722879,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 30
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 34,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If luck is on your side, you may catch sight\r\nof such accessories.\r\nSince they were discarded, there is no problem if\r\nyou take a liking to them and reclaim\r\nthem as yours, Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "運が良ければ、そのようなアクセサリーを\r\n目にされるかもしれません\r\n捨てていかれた物ですから、お気に召せば\r\n覚者様の物となさっても何の問題もありません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722880,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 31
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4512,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Bacias",
      "Jp" : "バシアス"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 23781,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 35,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, Ser Arisen intends to venture further into\r\nthe depths of Firefall Mountain.\r\nI shall reveal to you the truth that lies hidden\r\nwithin the mountain's heart, the secrets it has\r\nlong concealed from the world.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様は火垂れ山のさらに奥まで\r\n進まれるのですね\r\n――お話いたしましょう\r\n奥に何が巣食っているか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 652046,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 32
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4512,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Bacias",
      "Jp" : "バシアス"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 23782,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 36,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Welcome back, Ser Arisen.\r\nThank you for eliminating the dark\r\nmagick-wielding dragon!",
        "Jp" : "お帰りなさいませ、覚者様\r\n闇の魔法を操るドラゴンを排除していただき\r\nありがとうございました"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 652049,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 33
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 37,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This is just my speculation, but I believe\r\nFirefall Mountain is the place where the Dragon\r\nForce that travels through Acre\r\nSelund finally returns to.",
        "Jp" : "これはわたしの推測ですが\r\n火垂れ山はアッカーシェランの大地を巡る竜力が\r\n最後に還ってくる場所であると考えています"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722881,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 34
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 38,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That is why, even now,\r\nthat the Lord Fire Dragon is no longer with us,\r\nI deeply desired its retrieval.\r\nOriginally, the Dragon Force\r\nwas to return to the Lord Fire Dragon.\r\nMost likely, it will become\r\nthe power of fire itself\r\nand circulate the land once again.",
        "Jp" : "だからこそ、火竜様亡き今となっても\r\nどうしても取り戻しておきたかったのです\r\n本来であれば、火竜様の元に還るはずであった竜力\r\n恐らく、火の力となって再び大地を巡ることでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722882,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 35
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 39,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I don't know how long it will last, but until we\r\nfind a new path, I believe it is enough.",
        "Jp" : "それがいつまでもつかはわかりませんが\r\n我々が新たな道を見つけるまでは\r\n十分だと考えています"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 722883,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 36
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
